### 5.1 Low-level helpers (lines 40–173)

#### `_fill(hex_color)`

*Lines 40–41.* Returns a solid `PatternFill` in the given RRGGBB (or AARRGGBB) hex string.

**Called by** — every sheet builder plus `_styleHeader`, `_styleColumnHeaders`, `_colorPivotLowCells`.

