*Lines 552–617.* Sheet **"Scale Trends"** — per student: `avg_es, es_slope, first_third_es, last_third_es, avg_gr, gr_slope, first_third_gr, last_third_gr, avg_score, score_slope, avg_ts, avg_cs, avg_ps`.

