| Name | Signature | One line |
|---|---|---|
| `_meanScore` | `_meanScore(scoresDict)` | Mean of `v["score"]` over the `scores` dict; `NaN` if not a non-empty dict or no scores |
| `_lvl_dist` | `_lvl_dist(series, levels)` | Percentage at each rating level (1 dp), `0.0` for every level when there are no values |
| `_auto` | `_auto(col, override)` | `override` if given, else `round(mean − sdMultiplier·SD, 3)` |
